  hero_h1: {id:'Digital Growth Consulting', en:'Digital Growth Consulting'},
  hero_p: {id:'Konsultasi strategis buat bisnis yang mau tumbuh lebih terarah di dunia digital. Kami bantu audit kondisi digital kamu sekarang, dan susun roadmap pertumbuhan berdasarkan data, bukan tebak-tebakan.', en:'Strategic consulting for businesses that want more focused growth in the digital world. We help audit your current digital condition and build a growth roadmap based on data, not guesswork.'},
